# PR Details

## Description

Add `watch` and `mode` option for `builder.build` method:

```js
// Do production build (once)
builder.build();

// Do development build (once)
builder.build({
  mode: 'development'
});

// Do production build and watch file changes 
builder.build({
  watch: true,
  mode: 'production',
});

// Do development build and watch file changes 
builder.build({
  watch: true,
  mode: 'development'
});

```

